{"causes": ["The Kościuszko Uprising was sparked by the Polish people's growing frustration with the Russian and Prussian occupation of their country, which had led to economic hardship, cultural suppression, and the erosion of their national identity.", "Kościuszko's own experiences as a military engineer and national hero, as well as his exposure to the ideas of the Enlightenment and the French Revolution, inspired him to take action against the partitioning of Poland.", "The influence of the French Revolution and the ideas of liberty, equality, and fraternity had a profound impact on Kościuszko and the Polish people, who saw the uprising as an opportunity to restore their country's sovereignty and freedom."], "effects": ["The Kościuszko Uprising led to the continued partitioning of Poland, which would last for over a century and result in the loss of millions of lives and the destruction of Polish culture and identity.", "The uprising's failure also led to the exile of many Polish nobles and intellectuals, who would go on to play a key role in the country's struggle for independence in the 19th and 20th centuries.", "The Kościuszko Uprising's legacy can be seen in the continued struggle for Polish independence and self-determination, which would eventually lead to the emergence of Poland as a sovereign state in the 20th century."], "relationships": [{"sourceSlug": "kociuszko", "sourceName": "Tadeusz Kościuszko", "verb": "INFLUENCES", "targetSlug": "kociuszko-uprising", "targetName": "Kościuszko Uprising", "context": "Kościuszko led the Kościuszko Uprising, a pivotal event in the struggle for Polish independence, from 1794 to 1795."}, {"sourceSlug": "poland", "sourceName": "Poland", "verb": "PARTICIPATES_IN", "targetSlug": "kociuszko-uprising", "targetName": "Kościuszko Uprising", "context": "The Polish people participated in the Kościuszko Uprising, a pivotal event in the struggle for Polish independence, from 1794 to 1795."}, {"sourceSlug": "france", "sourceName